	For let 

	 not that man suppose that he will receive anything from the Lord;
 [Gen. 19:24;] [1 Cor. 9:12,] [1 John 2:19; 4:1] [[John 1:1]]

	So then, 

	 my beloved brethren, let every man be swift to hear, slow to speak, slow to wrath;
 [John 12:31;]

	For if 

	 anyone is a hearer of the word and not a doer, he is like a man observing his natural face in a mirror;
 [Rom. 11:14]
